   "text": "Voice memo pipeline, container view. 2026-10-16. Numbers 1-13 are the hops of one memo; dashed = read-only look-up; orange = per-turn wall clock path.\nSource of truth: workspace.dsl (Structurizr). HTML with C4 levels 1-3 and the dynamic view: voice-pipeline-c4.html",
   "originalText": "Voice memo pipeline, container view. 2026-10-16. Numbers 1-13 are the hops of one memo; dashed = read-only look-up; orange = per-turn wall clock path.\nSource of truth: workspace.dsl (Structurizr). HTML with C4 levels 1-3 and the dynamic view: voice-pipeline-c4.html",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
